  "solution": "Xếp An, Bình, Cường và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> bạn nữa thành một hàng ngang thì có số kết quả là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></semantics></math>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Biến cố <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>: ““ An và Bình đứng ở hai đầu hàng”” có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Bình và Cường đứng cạnh nhau””.<br>Để <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> xảy ra, trước tiên ta xếp chỗ cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>𝒩</mi></semantics></math> (đại diện Bình, Cường) và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> bạn còn lại (khác Bình Cường). Sau đó xếp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> bạn Bình, Cường vào đúng vị trí chỗ của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>𝒩</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>!</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>!</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math>: ““ An, Bình, Cường đứng cạnh nhau””.<br>Để <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> xảy ra, trước tiên ta xếp chỗ cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℳ</mi></semantics></math> (đại diện An, Bình, Cường) và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> bạn còn lại (khác An, Bình Cường). Sau đó xếp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> bạn An, Bình, Cường vào đúng vị trí chỗ của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℳ</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
